---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='日常与创作机制 · What We Do · wo/men in tech'
  description='在商业流水线之外，守住纯粹的手艺与思考。Coffee Chat、English Chat 与 作品 Lab。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='page-container'>
    <!-- 头部引导 -->
    <header class='page-header'>
      <span class='section-eyebrow'>WHAT WE DO</span>

      <div lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>
        <h1 class='page-title'>日常与创作机制</h1>
        <p class='page-lead'>
          在商业流水线之外，守住纯粹的手艺与思考。<br />
          给推敲留出时间，让灵感自然生长为经得起审视的器物与交流。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div lang='en' class='lang-en'>
        <h1 class='page-title'>What We Do · Circle Mechanics</h1>
        <p class='page-lead'>
          Holding space for pure craft and deliberate reflection outside commercial conveyor belts.<br />
          Giving work the time it deserves—enduring artifacts and unhurried exchanges.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='gold-hairline'></div>
    </header>

    <div class='events-detail-stack'>
      {/* 模块 1: Coffee Chat */}
      <article class='event-detail-card'>
        <div class='card-header-line'>
          <span class='card-index'>01</span>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='card-badge lang-zh'>双周轻聚 · 线上 / 杭州</span>
          <span lang='en' class='card-badge lang-en'>Biweekly · Online / Hangzhou</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class='card-title'>Coffee Chat</h2>
        
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='card-body lang-zh'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            这不是商务社交（networking），也不是换取资源的交易场。
          </p>
          <p>
            在杭州线下或线上视频室，三五个人，把手里的咖啡喝完。聊聊最近在做的事、阅读中的灵感卡壳、正在推敲的数字器物，或者纯粹听别人讲一段探索的经历。
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>守则 · Principles</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>真诚平等</strong>：不作职场说教与高下评断，只呈现真实的体悟与探索。</li>
              <li><strong>低压倾听</strong>：你可以畅所欲言，也可以选择全程安静聆听。</li>
              <li><strong>保护留白</strong>：每一次交流不设既定结论，让思考自然发酵。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div lang='en' class='card-body lang-en'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            Not networking, and never a transactional barter for industry leverage.
          </p>
          <p>
            In Hangzhou offline or via private video link, two or three of us finish our cups. We reflect on work-in-progress, lingering design thoughts, unfinished digital artifacts, or simply listen to someone's winding path.
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>Principles</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>Grounded Presence</strong>: No patronizing lectures; only genuine curiosity and unhurried craft experience.</li>
              <li><strong>Low-Pressure Presence</strong>: Speak whenever moved, or simply listen quietly from start to finish.</li>
              <li><strong>Preserving White Space</strong>: We never rush toward predetermined conclusions, giving space for organic serendipity.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* 模块 2: English Chat */}
      <article class='event-detail-card'>
        <div class='card-header-line'>
          <span class='card-index'>02</span>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='card-badge lang-zh'>双周线上 · 不定期</span>
          <span lang='en' class='card-badge lang-en'>Biweekly Virtual · 40–60 min</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class='card-title'>English Tech & Design Chat</h2>
        
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='card-body lang-zh'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            用英语聊产品、设计或代码，在安心宽容的环境里从容表达。
          </p>
          <p>
            全球化与独立出海并不遥远，很多时候阻碍我们的不是技术本身，而是开口前的审慎与自我怀疑。我们提供 40-60 分钟的轻量 Show & Tell：特邀分享嘉宾用 40 分钟英文讲述一个深有体会的界面细节、动效或代码架构，并在随后的 Q&A 环节与大家从容探讨。
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>收获 · Takeaways</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>安全语境</strong>：无论口语流利与否，这里只有耐心的倾听与真诚的反馈。</li>
              <li><strong>全球审美视野</strong>：接触海外优秀独立软件、开源美学与小而美产品模式。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div lang='en' class='card-body lang-en'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            Discussing product, interface craft, or code in English in a relaxed, supportive setting.
          </p>
          <p>
            Global craft is within reach, yet what often holds us back is self-censorship before speaking. We host a 40–60 minute intimate Show & Tell: featuring a guest speaker sharing an interface detail, micro-interaction, or code architecture in English for 40 minutes, followed by an open Q&A session.
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>Takeaways</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>Supportive Space</strong>: Irrespective of fluency, you will find generous patience and constructive curiosity.</li>
              <li><strong>Global Aesthetic Horizon</strong>: Engaging with international independent software, open-source gems, and soulful utility.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      {/* 模块 3: 作品 Lab */}
      <article class='event-detail-card'>
        <div class='card-header-line'>
          <span class='card-index'>03</span>
          <span lang='zh-CN' class='card-badge lang-zh'>慢工出细活 · 小组共建</span>
          <span lang='en' class='card-badge lang-en'>Deliberate Craft · Small Cohorts</span>
        </div>
        <h2 lang='zh-CN' class='card-title lang-zh'>作品 Lab · 代表作共建</h2>
        <h2 lang='en' class='card-title lang-en'>Craft Lab · Signature Works</h2>
        
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='card-body lang-zh'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            把那个在心里存了许久的想法拿出来，和同频的伙伴一起慢慢雕琢为立得住的器物。
          </p>
          <p>
            在工作中我们大多负责某一个螺丝钉环节，很少能完整掌控一件产品从哲学、交互到代码的整体质感。在作品 Lab 中，不同视角的女性创造者互借经验——设计师带来克制顶奢的审美体系，工程师提供严丝合缝的工程实现，研究者打磨真实的问题闭环。
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>标准 · Standard</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>只做值得的事</strong>：拒绝粗制滥造的练习稿，每一行代码与每一帧动效都经得起审视。</li>
              <li><strong>个人署名</strong>：所有合作方案完全归属于创作者本人，可直接作为独立代表作。</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div lang='en' class='card-body lang-en'>
          <p class='card-lead'>
            Taking that lingering intuition out of your journal and shaping it into an enduring artifact.
          </p>
          <p>
            In day jobs, we often inhabit isolated cogs, rarely holding complete stewardship over philosophy, interaction, and system integrity. In Craft Lab, women across PM, IxD, and Engineering lend each other perspective—refining taste, robustness, and genuine utility.
          </p>
          <div class='card-insight-box'>
            <span class='insight-label'>Craft Standards</span>
            <ul class='insight-list'>
              <li><strong>Only Work That Counts</strong>: No rushed boilerplate; every interaction frame and line of logic is treated with care.</li>
              <li><strong>Full Authorship</strong>: All shared artifacts remain entirely authored by their creators as personal signature portfolios.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    {/* 底部行动引导 */}
    <section class='next-steps'>
      <div class='next-card'>
        <div lang='zh-CN' class='next-text lang-zh'>
          <h3>想参加最近的一期交流？</h3>
          <p>查看近期的具体排期，或者直接告诉我们你的兴趣。</p>
        </div>
        <div lang='en' class='next-text lang-en'>
          <h3>Wish to join an upcoming circle?</h3>
          <p>Browse our current schedule or leave us a quiet note with your interests.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='next-actions'>
          <a href='/upcoming' class='btn-link-gold'>
            <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>查看近期排期 →</span>
            <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>View Schedule →</span>
          </a>
          <a href='/join' class='btn-solid-dark'>
            <span lang='zh-CN' class='lang-zh'>预约加入我们</span>
            <span lang='en' class='lang-en'>Join the Circle</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding: var(--spacing-6) 0 var(--spacing-20);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-12);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .gold-hairline {
    width: var(--spacing-12);
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .events-detail-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .event-detail-card {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-8) var(--spacing-6);
    transition: all 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .event-detail-card:last-child {
    border-bottom-color: transparent;
  }

  .event-detail-card:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px -6px rgba(38, 34, 28, 0.03);
  }

  .card-header-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .card-index {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .card-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-3);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .card-body {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
    letter-spacing: 0.015em;
  }

  .card-lead {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .card-insight-box {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-5);
    padding: var(--spacing-4) var(--spacing-5);
    background: var(--color-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-divider);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
  }

  .insight-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .insight-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .insight-list li {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  .insight-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .next-steps {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-16);
  }

  .next-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-8);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .next-text h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-1);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .next-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .next-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-4);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .btn-link-gold {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gold-dust) !important;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .btn-solid-dark {
    padding: var(--spacing-2) var(--spacing-5);
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    color: var(--color-surface-pure) !important;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    transition: background var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .btn-solid-dark:hover {
    background: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .page-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .event-detail-card {
      padding: var(--spacing-5) var(--spacing-4);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-6);
    }

    .card-header-line {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .card-insight-box {
      padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);
    }

    .next-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: var(--spacing-5) var(--spacing-4);
      gap: var(--spacing-4);
    }

    .next-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: var(--spacing-3);
    }

    .btn-solid-dark {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px 16px;
    }

    .btn-link-gold {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
